      "note": "STEREO TDA2030A AMPLIFIER: single 12 to 24 V supply, about 14 W a channel into 4 ohms at 24 V, gain about 22. Heatsink each chip by its tab, which is tied to its pin 3 (ground here), so one heatsink can serve both. Use 35 V capacitors. Inputs: RCA, white left, red right. Speakers: J1 left, J2 right; their terminals nearer the middle of each are ground."
